title: Add unincluded segment store for parablock resubmission
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Introduces `cumulus-client-unincluded-segment-store`, a new crate that persists a
    storage-proof entry per imported parablock to support unincluded-segment resubmission.
    Entries are pruned on finality and by relay-parent session age.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-unincluded-segment-store
  bump: major
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-aura
  bump: minor
- name: cumulus-client-consensus-common
  bump: minor
